## Tags (etags/ctags output)
tags
tags.*
TAGS
TAGS.*
# But not the rust-analyzer source file named tags.rs — that's a real
# module and was being silently ignored, leading to E0583 (file not
# found for module `tags`) on stage2 builds.
!src/tools/rust-analyzer/crates/ide/src/syntax_highlighting/tags.rs

